<title>BULGARIA: BULGARIAN BANKING STATISTICS - UPDATED JULY 21.</title>
<headline>BULGARIAN BANKING STATISTICS - UPDATED JULY 21.</headline>
<text>
<p>(Updates with figures for M1, M2 and broad money as of July</p>
<p>11 and a cut in the central bank main interest rate)</p>
<p>Central exchange rate-Bulgarian National Bank (BNB) daily fix:</p>
<p>Levs/dollar 1,799.00(July21) 495.74(Dec30) 70.719(Dec30'95)</p>
<p>Broad money, bln levs:</p>
<p>4,491.9(July11) 4,017.8(June27) 3,491.8(May30) 3,138.4(Apr25)</p>
<p>M1 nominal, bln levs: 1,121.4 July 11</p>
<p>M1 pct change  +26.18 (July11-June27); +25.77 (June27-May30);</p>
<p>M2 nominal, bln levs: 4,271.3 July 11</p>
<p>M2 pct change  +12.37 (July11-June27); +14.92 (June27-May30)</p>
<p>Central bank main interest rate - 6.12 pct simple annual from</p>
<p>July 21  (6.96 pct July 14-20)</p>
<p>Money market lev funds rate, annual - 2.0-4.5 pct</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, 359-2-91188</p>
